WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.717
We live in dozens of apps, tabs and notifications.

00:00:03.717 --> 00:00:07.555
We multitask all day, and now AI does whole tasks for us.

00:00:07.555 --> 00:00:11.326
So… where is my time going? What am I actually learning?

00:00:11.326 --> 00:00:13.279
And what should I do to grow?

00:00:14.179 --> 00:00:15.284
Magic fixes that.

00:00:15.284 --> 00:00:22.307
It records everything you do on your laptop, privately, and local AI turns it into an honest picture of you.

00:00:22.307 --> 00:00:25.753
Your real skills, how you think, and what to do next.

00:00:25.753 --> 00:00:29.134
Other tools help you remember. Magic helps you grow.

00:00:30.034 --> 00:00:31.379
Let me show you mine.

00:00:33.234 --> 00:00:35.857
This is my own Magic, after three weeks.

00:00:35.857 --> 00:00:39.070
Twenty thousand moments, nearly a thousand ideas.

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:43.069
And it has figured out who I am: a strategic systems builder.

00:00:43.969 --> 00:00:48.204
It reads my personality from how I actually work, not from a quiz.

00:00:48.204 --> 00:00:52.887
Tap a trait, and it shows you why, with the evidence behind every number.

00:00:53.787 --> 00:00:57.415
It knows how I think, how I learn, and how I make decisions.

00:00:58.315 --> 00:00:59.385
And it's honest.

00:00:59.385 --> 00:01:03.798
It names my blind spots, gently, with one small thing to try next.

00:01:04.698 --> 00:01:10.736
It shows how deep my knowledge goes in every area of my life, and even the hours when I learn best.

00:01:11.636 --> 00:01:13.749
Now, let's go one level deeper.

00:01:15.036 --> 00:01:19.196
Every area of your life becomes a topic. Here's data engineering.

00:01:19.196 --> 00:01:24.573
Magic says I'm proficient, and it tells me exactly what separates me from an expert.

00:01:25.473 --> 00:01:28.365
Then it gives me a path forward. Not a course list.

00:01:28.365 --> 00:01:32.279
Three real steps, each with how to do it, and how I'll know I'm done.

00:01:33.179 --> 00:01:37.830
It pairs me with mentors for my stage, and the standards they hold themselves to.

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:44.109
Here's where I stand in each part of the field, and how far I've come since my first week.

00:01:44.109 --> 00:01:47.157
Tap one, and it tells the story of how I got there.

00:01:48.057 --> 00:01:52.671
Every idea I've touched sits on this map, shaded by how well I know it.

00:01:52.671 --> 00:01:56.570
Tap a part, and see each idea, and exactly how I learned it.

00:01:57.470 --> 00:02:02.548
And every lesson and open question is kept, so nothing I learn is ever lost again.

00:02:04.578 --> 00:02:07.551
Capturing your screen is becoming a commodity.

00:02:07.551 --> 00:02:10.396
But what you're becoming is still invisible.

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:12.787
Magic is your personal context layer.

00:02:12.787 --> 00:02:15.567
Every tool and AI agent you use can ask it:

00:02:15.567 --> 00:02:18.605
who is this person, and what do they need next?

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:21.901
Only with your permission, and only on your device.

00:02:22.801 --> 00:02:24.551
Magic. See how you grow.
